 * D8.4 documents, compliance register, instructions log and approval requests for the mock API.
 * It applies the shared domain rules (packages/domain: revision order, compliance status in
 * Nairobi dates, instruction moves, approval independence) and returns the shared response
 * schemas, so the browser tests exercise the real wire contract. Dates are relative to today in
 * Nairobi. Synthetic data only; files are tiny generated bytes.
 */
